WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.260
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.809
No anomalous shadow puppets!

00:00:06.809 --> 00:00:12.849
SCP-017 is a shadow person prone to engulfing
and absorbing anything that casts a shadow

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:13.849
on it.

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:18.460
For this reason, Dr. Bright is strictly prohibited
from making "shadow puppets" with the entity.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.090
Why would you even want to?

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:22.199
Do you value your life at all?

00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:26.830
As annoying as he can be sometimes, we don't
want Dr. Bright to disappear altogether, so

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.290
we've put this particular rule in place to
protect him from himself.

